WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.415
The children stood outside the door and looked around.

2
00:00:05.416 --> 00:00:10.426
"Which house did Haruki put us in?" asked Vinnie.

3
00:00:10.427 --> 00:00:15.210
"The doors all look the same," said Mandy.

4
00:00:15.211 --> 00:00:20.166
The children walked around trying to find their way back.

5
00:00:20.167 --> 00:00:23.644
But they were lost.

6
00:00:23.645 --> 00:00:29.499
Soon the smell of cooking led the children to a kitchen.

7
00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:32.776
Servants were busily preparing a meal.

8
00:00:32.777 --> 00:00:35.671
One woman saw them.

9
00:00:35.672 --> 00:00:41.828
She was standing over a large pot of steaming rice on a stone stove.

10
00:00:41.829 --> 00:00:46.603
"Is the tea ceremony over already?" she asked.

11
00:00:46.604 --> 00:00:48.981
Mandy shook her head and asked,

12
00:00:48.982 --> 00:00:52.975
"How long does it usually last?"

13
00:00:52.976 --> 00:00:57.348
"Two to four hours," the woman replied.

14
00:00:57.349 --> 00:01:03.829
"Two hours? I’m glad we got out of there," said Vinnie.

15
00:01:03.830 --> 00:01:08.124
Mandy was looking out a small window.

16
00:01:08.125 --> 00:01:11.472
"A path leads around the kitchen.

17
00:01:11.473 --> 00:01:15.084
It might take us to the front entrance.

18
00:01:15.085 --> 00:01:19.556
We can find the house from there."

19
00:01:19.557 --> 00:01:25.213
The children stepped outside and walked down the path.

20
00:01:25.214 --> 00:01:30.743
But it led them away from the kitchen and into a forest.

21
00:01:30.744 --> 00:01:33.556
"We’re really lost now,"

22
00:01:33.557 --> 00:01:38.271
said Vinnie, realizing how far they had walked.

23
00:01:38.272 --> 00:01:43.509
"My feet hurt," said Mandy.

24
00:01:43.510 --> 00:01:47.106
They had taken their shoes off at the house.

25
00:01:47.107 --> 00:01:51.955
Mandy sat down on a rock and rubbed her bare feet.

26
00:01:51.956 --> 00:01:55.987
"What should we do?" asked Vinnie.

27
00:01:55.988 --> 00:01:57.927
He sat beside her.

28
00:01:57.928 --> 00:02:02.261
A tree branch cracked nearby.

29
00:02:02.262 --> 00:02:06.000
"Who’s there?" Vinnie said.

30
00:02:06.001 --> 00:02:10.005
A young girl stepped out of the trees.

31
00:02:10.006 --> 00:02:17.330
She was not wearing a kimono but a gray colored top, pants, and straw sandals.

32
00:02:17.331 --> 00:02:22.146
She was holding a basket full of flowers.

33
00:02:22.147 --> 00:02:28.990
"That outfit looks much more comfortable," Mandy said to herself.

34
00:02:28.991 --> 00:02:33.014
She looked at her tight kimono.

35
00:02:33.015 --> 00:02:37.632
"I am Seiko," the girl said shyly.

36
00:02:37.633 --> 00:02:41.868
"Where did you come from?"

37
00:02:41.869 --> 00:02:47.257
"From Daimyo Masamune’s house," answered Vinnie.

38
00:02:47.258 --> 00:02:51.394
"Excuse me," Mandy interrupted.

39
00:02:51.395 --> 00:02:55.016
"Where can we get some shoes?"

40
00:02:55.017 --> 00:03:00.137
"Come with me," she said.

41
00:03:00.138 --> 00:03:03.706
She giggled and covered her mouth.

42
00:03:03.707 --> 00:03:11.183
The children followed Seiko and soon they came to a busy street.

43
00:03:11.184 --> 00:03:15.129
Farmers pushed their carts down the road.

44
00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:21.499
Women in colorful kimonos tiptoed by, whispering and giggling.

45
00:03:21.500 --> 00:03:26.748
"Is this your first time in Sendai?" asked Seiko.

46
00:03:26.749 --> 00:03:30.492
"Yes," replied the children.

47
00:03:30.493 --> 00:03:34.721
They stared at everything around them.

48
00:03:34.722 --> 00:03:38.929
One side of the street had only bookstores.

49
00:03:38.930 --> 00:03:44.005
Shops on the other side sold only things made of straw.

50
00:03:44.006 --> 00:03:46.015
"This is like China!

51
00:03:46.016 --> 00:03:50.355
It’s easy to find what you want," said Vinnie.

52
00:03:50.356 --> 00:03:56.322
Seiko took them to a shop selling straw hats, mats, and shoes.

53
00:03:56.323 --> 00:03:58.661
"This is my aunt’s shop,"

54
00:03:58.662 --> 00:04:04.407
said Seiko, handing the children two pairs of straw sandals.

55
00:04:04.408 --> 00:04:07.601
"Do they fit your feet?"

56
00:04:07.602 --> 00:04:18.756
The sandals fit perfectly, but they looked funny with the children’s silk kimono.

